[[File:map008.png|center|350px]]
'''Dawn of the Beginning''' (始まりを告げる朝, ''Hajimari wo Tsugeru Asa'', '''The Morning That Will Tell the Beginning''') is the 30th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 79th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. This sub-chapter centers on late-game enemies.

==Difficulty==
A joke of a sub-chapter compared to the previous ones. With a competent strategy, most of these stages will prove to be very easy.
However, [[Passionate Release]] may be difficult without decently leveled [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie]] or [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|Anti-Relic]] cats.
