==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]], Dawn of the Beginning is the opposite of [[Dead End Night]]. Dead End Night is '''The Night That Will Tell the End''' (終わりを告げる夜) while Dawn of the Beginning is '''The Morning That Will Tell the Beginning''' (始まりを告げる朝).
*With the exception of [[Buried Hypocrisy]], each stage's name is a subtle inversion of one from Dead End Night:
**[[A Dutiful Prayer]] = [[Feast of Betrayal]] (dutiful vs. treasonous)
**[[Dilemma of Birth]] = [[Catharsis' End]] (uncertain beginning vs indubitable end)
**[[The Ivory Oracle]] = [[Dark Premonition]] (white vs. black)
**[[Persona's Blooming]] = [[Broken Mask]] (development vs. destruction)
**[[Passionate Release]] = [[Agape's Cage]] (release vs. entrapment)
***Incidentally, this sub-chapter was added in the same update as a placeholder enemy named コニャンダム亜種 (''Ko Nyandamu Ashu,'' "[[Li'l Nyandam (Enemy)|Li'l Nyandam]] Variant"), whose ID was later used for [[Evil Emperor Cat]].

